ps—cognitive friction—we force organizations to maintain the capacity for critical oversight rather than treating human input as a rubber stamp. Policymakers should treat AI deployment in hiring as a regulated utility, where the burden of proof rests on the developer to demonstrate that the system enhances, rather than replaces, human ethical judgment. ⚖️",
