e the 'governance mirage' of DAL with requirements for internal logic disclosure, as the current focus on output variance ignores the reality that systemic bias is often embedded in the very architecture of the software. I challenge the accelerationist position to explain how a static 80% threshold provides any protection against the sophisticated proxy-laundering that already defines high-stakes automated gatekeeping.",
